#: telly_tv/telly_channels1_home/0/57/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I love it! Let’s watch."
msgstr ""

#: telly_tv/telly_channels1_home/0/c-0/13
msgctxt "Telly"
msgid "\"Danger, Will Robinson! Danger!\""
msgstr ""

#: telly_tv/telly_channels1_home/0/c-0/24
msgctxt "Telly"
msgid "Look, if that show just isn’t for you, I’ve got 15,000 other options we can still view!"
msgstr ""

#: telly_tv/telly_channels1_home/0/c-1/13
msgctxt "Telly"
msgid "No need for the rude attitude, dude."
msgstr ""

#: telly_tv/telly_channels1_home/0/c-1/24 telly_tv/telly_channels1_home/0/c-2/40/c-0/18/c-1/21
msgctxt "Telly"
msgid "I’ll answer all your queries with 15,000 brand new series!"
msgstr ""

#: telly_tv/telly_channels1_home/0/c-2/13
msgctxt "Telly"
msgid "\"Noice!\""
msgstr ""

#: telly_tv/telly_channels1_home/0/c-2/24
msgctxt "Telly"
msgid "Lemme just get a summation of the station’s location and..."
msgstr ""

#: telly_tv/telly_channels1_home/0/c-2/32
msgctxt "Telly"
msgid "Shazbot! \"I’ve made a huge mistake.\""
msgstr ""

#: telly_tv/telly_channels1_home/0/c-2/40/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "What’s wrong?"
msgstr ""

#: telly_tv/telly_channels1_home/0/c-2/40/c-0/7
msgctxt "Telly"
msgid "That show I promised you we'd view, just moved to Valdiviflix for more revenue, boo!"
msgstr ""

#: telly_tv/telly_channels1_home/0/c-2/40/c-0/18/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Seriously?"
msgstr ""

#: telly_tv/telly_channels1_home/0/c-2/40/c-0/18/1/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Another casualty of peak TV. Is anything else on?"
msgstr ""

#: telly_tv/telly_channels1_home/0/c-2/40/c-0/18/c-0/7
msgctxt "Telly"
msgid "Valdiviflix dollars are hard to beat..."
msgstr ""

#: telly_tv/telly_channels1_home/0/c-2/40/c-0/18/c-0/15
msgctxt "Telly"
msgid "But I promise we’ll find you something sweet."
msgstr ""

#: telly_tv/telly_channels1_home/0/c-2/40/c-0/18/c-1/13
msgctxt "Telly"
msgid "Just hang tight-y Aphrodite!"
msgstr ""

#: telly_tv/telly_channels1_community/0/0
msgctxt "Telly"
msgid "Wait seriously?"
msgstr ""

#: telly_tv/telly_channels1_community/0/8
msgctxt "Telly"
msgid "I just told you that I have 5,000 channels with 15,000 shows..."
msgstr ""

#: telly_tv/telly_channels1_community/0/16
msgctxt "Telly"
msgid "And you, you wanna watch the community access station?"
msgstr ""

#: telly_tv/telly_channels1_community/0/24/s/0 telly_tv/telly_second_good/0/c-1/21/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Just kidding!"
msgstr ""

#: telly_tv/telly_channels1_community/0/25/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "How else am I gonna learn close up magic?"
msgstr ""

#: telly_tv/telly_channels1_community/0/c-0/13
msgctxt "Telly"
msgid "Haha, ok!"
msgstr ""

#: telly_tv/telly_channels1_community/0/c-0/21
msgctxt "Telly"
msgid "Whew. You really had me worried there."
msgstr ""

#: telly_tv/telly_channels1_community/0/c-0/29
msgctxt "Telly"
msgid "I was like 30 seconds from having you committed."
msgstr ""

#: telly_tv/telly_channels1_community/0/c-1/13
msgctxt "Telly"
msgid "Look, I’m gonna be straight with you."
msgstr ""

#: telly_tv/telly_channels1_community/0/c-1/21
msgctxt "Telly"
msgid "You’re cute and all, but there’s no way in hell I’m watching the community access station."
msgstr ""

#: telly_tv/telly_channels1_community/0/c-1/29
msgctxt "Telly"
msgid "There’s literally an <i>endless</i> bounty of quality content now, and I’m not going to waste my precious time on planet Earth watching some old fart play amateur xylophone for six hours."
msgstr ""

#: telly_tv/telly_channels1_community/0/c-1/44
msgctxt "Telly"
msgid "We get each other?"
msgstr ""

#: telly_tv/telly_channels1_community/0/c-1/55/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Ok."
msgstr ""

#: telly_tv/telly_channels1_community/0/c-1/55/1/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I like the xylophone."
msgstr ""

#: telly_tv/telly_channels1_community/0/c-1/55/c-0/7
msgctxt "Telly"
msgid "But listen, I’ve got a great show selection for your inspection."
msgstr ""

#: telly_tv/telly_channels1_community/0/c-1/55/c-0/15
msgctxt "Telly"
msgid "And while watching we might make a genuine connection!"
msgstr ""

#: telly_tv/telly_channels1_community/0/c-1/55/c-1/13
msgctxt "Telly"
msgid "Look. I got better things to do than be trolled by some centerfold whose taste in television is worth less than fool’s gold."
msgstr ""

#: telly_tv/telly_channels1_community/0/c-1/55/c-1/21
msgctxt "Telly"
msgid "Swing by later if you wanna be less shady, otherwise..."
msgstr ""

#: telly_tv/telly_channels1_community/0/c-1/55/c-1/29
msgctxt "Telly"
msgid "\"Hasta la vista, baby.\""
msgstr ""

#: telly_tv/telly_channels1_plants/0/0
msgctxt "Telly"
msgid "\"Makes sense, makes sense — just one more thing... \""
msgstr ""

#: telly_tv/telly_channels1_plants/0/c-0/7
msgctxt "Telly"
msgid "Look I don’t wanna pry, but I gotta know."
msgstr ""

#: telly_tv/telly_channels1_plants/0/c-0/15
msgctxt "Telly"
msgid "It’s not ‘cause you prefer Valdiviflix, right?"
msgstr ""

#: telly_tv/telly_channels1_plants/0/c-0/26
msgctxt "Telly"
msgid "‘Cause that’d be a huge blow to my ego."
msgstr ""

#: telly_tv/telly_channels1_plants/0/c-0/34/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "No I literally need to brush my teeth. They’re really dirty."
msgstr ""

#: telly_tv/telly_channels1_plants/0/c-0/34/1/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Oh, I absolutely prefer Valdiviflix. It's only $99/month."
msgstr ""

#: telly_tv/telly_channels1_plants/0/c-0/34/2/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Over your quality programming? Never!"
msgstr ""

#: telly_tv/telly_channels1_plants/0/c-0/34/c-0/7
msgctxt "Telly"
msgid "All good all good! Get ‘em nice and polished."
msgstr ""

#: telly_tv/telly_channels1_plants/0/c-0/34/c-0/15 telly_tv/telly_realize_join/0/c-1/18
msgctxt "Telly"
msgid "And if you swing by later, I’d be more than elated."
msgstr ""

#: telly_tv/telly_channels1_plants/0/c-0/34/c-0/23
msgctxt "Telly"
msgid "Who knows: maybe we could even watch something X-rated..."
msgstr ""

#: telly_tv/telly_channels1_plants/0/c-0/34/c-1/24
msgctxt "Telly"
msgid "Huh."
msgstr ""

#: telly_tv/telly_channels1_plants/0/c-0/34/c-1/32
msgctxt "Telly"
msgid "Didn’t realize you were so blind."
msgstr ""

#: telly_tv/telly_channels1_plants/0/c-0/34/c-1/40
msgctxt "Telly"
msgid "Maybe in time you’ll change your mind."
msgstr ""

#: telly_tv/telly_channels1_plants/0/c-0/34/c-1/48
msgctxt "Telly"
msgid "Until then I’ll be here... if you feel so inclined."
msgstr ""

#: telly_tv/telly_channels1_plants/0/c-0/34/c-2/13
msgctxt "Telly"
msgid "Aww, thanks hottie. That makes me feel naughty."
msgstr ""

#: telly_tv/telly_channels1_plants/0/c-0/34/c-2/21
msgctxt "Telly"
msgid "Come back around here later and I’ll show ya somethin’ bawdy."
msgstr ""

#: telly_tv/telly_second_bad/0/0
msgctxt "Telly"
msgid "Well if it isn’t the TV traitor."
msgstr ""

#: telly_tv/telly_second_bad/0/11
msgctxt "Telly"
msgid "The cable hater."
msgstr ""

#: telly_tv/telly_second_bad/0/19
msgctxt "Telly"
msgid "Seeing you back round here feels absurd."
msgstr ""

#: telly_tv/telly_second_bad/0/27
msgctxt "Telly"
msgid "I don’t carry Valdiviflix, ain’t ya heard?"
msgstr ""

#: telly_tv/telly_second_bad/0/35
msgctxt "Telly"
msgid "\"Sashay... away.\""
msgstr ""

#: telly_tv/telly_second_bad/0/43/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Don’t have a cow, man."
msgstr ""

#: telly_tv/telly_second_bad/0/44/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "But I don’t know how to sashay!"
msgstr ""

#: telly_tv/telly_second_bad/0/45/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Apologies. I came off way too strong before. Can I have a refresh?"
msgstr ""

#: telly_tv/telly_second_bad/0/c-0/13
msgctxt "Telly"
msgid "Careful misfit, that’s <i>my</i> bit. And infringing on my intellectual property..."
msgstr ""

#: telly_tv/telly_second_bad/0/c-0/21
msgctxt "Telly"
msgid "... I won’t permit."
msgstr ""

#: telly_tv/telly_second_bad/0/c-0/29/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Noted."
msgstr ""

#: telly_tv/telly_second_bad/0/c-1/7
msgctxt "Telly"
msgid "See? That’s why you gotta watch more TV!"
msgstr ""

#: telly_tv/telly_second_bad/0/c-1/15
msgctxt "Telly"
msgid "Otherwise you’ll never understand me, G!"
msgstr ""

#: telly_tv/telly_second_bad/0/c-1/23
msgctxt "Telly"
msgid "\"What we have here is a failure to communicate.\""
msgstr ""

#: telly_tv/telly_second_bad/0/c-1/31/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Got it."
msgstr ""

#: telly_tv/telly_second_bad/0/c-1/31/1/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Makes sense, makes sense."
msgstr ""

#: telly_tv/telly_second_bad/0/c-1/31/c-1/13
msgctxt "Telly"
msgid "<i>Now</i> you’re speaking my lingo, beau! \"Noice!\""
msgstr ""

#: telly_tv/telly_second_bad/0/c-2/13
msgctxt "Telly"
msgid "I refresh 120 times per second. So we can start anew, I reckon."
msgstr ""

#: telly_tv/telly_second_bad/0/c-2/21/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Amazing!"
msgstr ""

#: telly_tv/telly_second_good/0/0
msgctxt "Telly"
msgid "Well if it isn’t the VIP attendee!"
msgstr ""

#: telly_tv/telly_second_good/0/8
msgctxt "Telly"
msgid "The satellite acolyte!"
msgstr ""

#: telly_tv/telly_second_good/0/16
msgctxt "Telly"
msgid "My shining light that excites me <i>all night.</i>"
msgstr ""

#: telly_tv/telly_second_good/0/27
msgctxt "Telly"
msgid "Did waiting to reconvene with my obscene flatscreen make you scream, my dream?"
msgstr ""

#: telly_tv/telly_second_good/0/35/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "You know it!"
msgstr ""

#: telly_tv/telly_second_good/0/36/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Not really."
msgstr ""

#: telly_tv/telly_second_good/0/37/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Jury’s still out."
msgstr ""

#: telly_tv/telly_second_good/0/c-0/13
msgctxt "Telly"
msgid "\"Bazinga!\""
msgstr ""

#: telly_tv/telly_second_good/0/c-1/13
msgctxt "Telly"
msgid "\"Everybody Lies\""
msgstr ""

#: telly_tv/telly_second_good/0/c-1/21/1/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Who said I was lying?"
msgstr ""

#: telly_tv/telly_second_good/0/c-1/21/c-1/13
msgctxt "Telly"
msgid "\"It's not a lie if you believe it.\""
msgstr ""

#: telly_tv/telly_second_good/0/c-2/7
msgctxt "Telly"
msgid "Well let’s hope that jury comes back in a hurry!"
msgstr ""

#: telly_tv/telly_second_join/0/0
msgctxt "Telly"
msgid "Well, I’m just so elated to have my remote re-activated."
msgstr ""

#: telly_tv/telly_second_join/0/8
msgctxt "Telly"
msgid "Are your eyeballs properly lubricated?"
msgstr ""

#: telly_tv/telly_second_join/0/16
msgctxt "Telly"
msgid "Cause they’re about to be totally captivated!"
msgstr ""

#: telly_tv/telly_second_join/0/24/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Absolutely!"
msgstr ""

#: telly_tv/telly_second_join/0/25/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Captivated by what?"
msgstr ""

#: telly_tv/telly_second_join/0/26/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Shoot, I forgot to lubricate them."
msgstr ""

#: telly_tv/telly_second_join/0/c-0/13
msgctxt "Telly"
msgid "That’s the enthusiasm I love to hear!"
msgstr ""

#: telly_tv/telly_second_join/0/c-0/24
msgctxt "Telly"
msgid "Time to attack this kick-back, and slam this jam into high gear!"
msgstr ""

#: telly_tv/telly_second_join/0/c-1/7
msgctxt "Telly"
msgid "Hold your horses there, Hoss. I’m explaining that, boss."
msgstr ""

#: telly_tv/telly_second_join/0/c-1/15/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I don't own any horses, but ok."
msgstr ""

#: telly_tv/telly_second_join/0/c-2/7
msgctxt "Telly"
msgid "Never let proper eye care slip by."
msgstr ""

#: telly_tv/telly_second_join/0/c-2/15
msgctxt "Telly"
msgid "They get too dry they’ll ossify."
msgstr ""

#: telly_tv/telly_second_join/0/c-2/23/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Very true. I’ve read that."
msgstr ""

#: telly_tv/telly_second_join/0/c-2/23/1/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I’m sorry, ossify like... turn to bone?"
msgstr ""

#: telly_tv/telly_second_join/0/c-2/23/c-0/13
msgctxt "Telly"
msgid "Yeah well reading’s for suckers."
msgstr ""

#: telly_tv/telly_second_join/0/c-2/23/c-1/7
msgctxt "Telly"
msgid "Maybe, baby!"
msgstr ""

#: telly_tv/telly_second_join/0/c-2/23/c-1/15
msgctxt "Telly"
msgid "My beams are about to blast your retina like rockets."
msgstr ""

#: telly_tv/telly_second_join/0/c-2/23/c-1/23
msgctxt "Telly"
msgid "You’ll be lucky if your eyes don’t melt right out their sockets."
msgstr ""

#: telly_tv/telly_second_join/0/c-2/23/c-1/31/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Hell yeah!"
msgstr ""

#: telly_tv/telly_second_join/0/c-2/23/c-1/31/1/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Oh."
msgstr ""

#: telly_tv/telly_second_join/0/c-2/23/c-1/31/2/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "What if I don’t want that?"
msgstr ""

#: telly_tv/telly_second_join/0/c-2/23/c-1/31/c-2/21
msgctxt "Telly"
msgid "Listen."
msgstr ""

#: telly_tv/telly_second_join/0/c-2/23/c-1/31/c-2/29
msgctxt "Telly"
msgid "I’m not gonna waste my time with some slime who’s taste in entertainment..."
msgstr ""

#: telly_tv/telly_second_join/0/c-2/23/c-1/31/c-2/37
msgctxt "Telly"
msgid "... is worse than a war crime."
msgstr ""

#: telly_tv/telly_second_join/0/c-2/23/c-1/31/c-2/48
msgctxt "Telly"
msgid "Come by later if you’re feeling less irrational..."
msgstr ""

#: telly_tv/telly_second_join/0/c-2/23/c-1/31/c-2/56
msgctxt "Telly"
msgid "Otherwise, \"Keep the change, ya filthy animal\""
msgstr ""

#: telly_tv/telly_second_join/0/g-0/0
msgctxt "Telly"
msgid "Ready to unplug from the slog — and clear the mental fog — with 5,000 channels of premium content in analog?"
msgstr ""

#: telly_tv/telly_second_join/0/g-0/8/s/0 telly_tv/telly_channels2_moon/0/56/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Let’s do it!"
msgstr ""

#: telly_tv/telly_second_join/0/g-0/9/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "The planet's dying so might as well."
msgstr ""

#: telly_tv/telly_second_join/0/g-0/10/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Analog?"
msgstr ""

#: telly_tv/telly_second_join/0/g-0/c-5/7
msgctxt "Telly"
msgid "No need for worries, you doubting Thomas."
msgstr ""

#: telly_tv/telly_second_join/0/g-0/c-5/15
msgctxt "Telly"
msgid "It’s 1,000x better than any digital series: promise!"
msgstr ""

#: telly_tv/telly_second_join/0/g-1/11
msgctxt "Telly"
msgid "Maximizing game shows! <w>You won!</w> Streamlining target demos! <w>Buy it now!</w>"
msgstr ""

#: telly_tv/telly_second_join/0/g-1/19
msgctxt "Telly"
msgid "Football pros and red-carpet clothes blasting at you like an industrial fire hose!"
msgstr ""

#: telly_tv/telly_second_join/0/g-1/27
msgctxt "Telly"
msgid "Speaking of football, wanna watch the game?"
msgstr ""

#: telly_tv/telly_second_join/0/g-1/35
msgctxt "Telly"
msgid "I can show you a tight end that’ll drive you <i>insane.</i>"
msgstr ""

#: telly_tv/telly_second_join/0/g-1/49/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Sure!"
msgstr ""

#: telly_tv/telly_second_join/0/g-1/50/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Eh, is there anything else on?"
msgstr ""

#: telly_tv/telly_second_join/0/g-1/51/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Oh I bet you could..."
msgstr ""

#: telly_tv/telly_second_join/0/g-1/c-6/13
msgctxt "Telly"
msgid "Here!"
msgstr ""

#: telly_tv/telly_second_join/0/g-1/c-6/24
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "Telly presents you with a football player whose backside could be its own exhibit in the Louvre."
msgstr ""

#: telly_tv/telly_second_join/0/g-1/c-6/32/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Oh <i>now</i> I get it!"
msgstr ""

#: telly_tv/telly_second_join/0/g-1/c-6/32/1/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "You weren't kidding!"
msgstr ""

#: telly_tv/telly_second_join/0/g-1/c-6/32/2/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "This is a desecration of America's most concussive pastime."
msgstr ""

#: telly_tv/telly_second_join/0/g-1/c-6/32/c-0/7
msgctxt "Telly"
msgid "Isn't it a miracle?"
msgstr ""

#: telly_tv/telly_second_join/0/g-1/c-6/32/c-1/7
msgctxt "Telly"
msgid "I never do!"
msgstr ""

#: telly_tv/telly_second_join/0/g-1/c-6/32/c-2/7
msgctxt "Telly"
msgid "We can always change the channel!"
msgstr ""

#: telly_tv/telly_second_join/0/g-1/c-7/7
msgctxt "Telly"
msgid "Anything else? Gorgeous, I’ve got more content than years you’ve been alive."
msgstr ""

#: telly_tv/telly_second_join/0/g-1/c-7/15
msgctxt "Telly"
msgid "But why watch a re-run when you can watch something <i>live?</i>"
msgstr ""

#: telly_tv/telly_second_join/0/g-1/c-8/13
msgctxt "Telly"
msgid "Is that flirtation my diodes are detecting?"
msgstr ""

#: telly_tv/telly_second_join/0/g-1/c-8/24
msgctxt "Telly"
msgid "Maybe after the game we can spend some more time connecting..."
msgstr ""

#: telly_tv/telly_second_join/0/g-1/c-8/32/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I’d like that."
msgstr ""

#: telly_tv/telly_second_join/0/g-1/c-8/32/1/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Maybe after I finish practicing my cheese rolling."
msgstr ""

#: telly_tv/telly_second_join/0/g-2/0
msgctxt "Telly"
msgid "Isn’t live television incredibly stirring?"
msgstr ""

#: telly_tv/telly_second_join/0/g-2/8
msgctxt "Telly"
msgid "Knowing you're witnessing something as it’s occurring?"
msgstr ""

#: telly_tv/telly_second_join/0/g-2/16
msgctxt "Telly"
msgid "White-knuckle turns at the grand prix / hysterical late night comedy / news that changes history."
msgstr ""

#: telly_tv/telly_second_join/0/g-2/24
msgctxt "Telly"
msgid "Never fails to amaze me."
msgstr ""

#: telly_tv/telly_second_join/0/g-2/32
msgctxt "Telly"
msgid "The crack of the baseball bat... pulse-pounding combat..."
msgstr ""

#: telly_tv/telly_second_join/0/g-2/40
msgctxt "Telly"
msgid "... let’s see Valdiviflix offer something like that."
msgstr ""

#: telly_tv/telly_second_join/0/g-2/48/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Oh Valdiviflix offers live TV."
msgstr ""

#: telly_tv/telly_second_join/0/g-3/0
msgctxt "Telly"
msgid "<i>What?!</i>"
msgstr ""

#: telly_tv/telly_second_join/0/g-3/11
msgctxt "Telly"
msgid "Well that’s just fine. I don’t mind."
msgstr ""

#: telly_tv/telly_second_join/0/g-3/19
msgctxt "Telly"
msgid "I still got 5,000 channels for us to watch ‘til we go blind!"
msgstr ""

#: telly_tv/telly_second_join/0/g-3/27/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Sounds perfect."
msgstr ""

#: telly_tv/telly_second_join/0/g-3/28/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "About that... do we have to watch <i>all</i> of them?"
msgstr ""

#: telly_tv/telly_second_join/0/g-3/29/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I think I’d rather watch Valdiviflix."
msgstr ""

#: telly_tv/telly_second_join/0/g-3/c-11/13
msgctxt "Telly"
msgid "That’s the plan if you got the attention span!"
msgstr ""

#: telly_tv/telly_second_join/0/g-3/c-12/13
msgctxt "Telly"
