#: telly_tv/telly_fourth_encounter/0/g-0/8
msgctxt "Telly"
msgid "Optimizing prestige TV! Maximizing your fees so it’s commercial free!"
msgstr ""

#: telly_tv/telly_fourth_encounter/0/g-0/19
msgctxt "Telly"
msgid "White-knuckle thrillers and serial killers and endless ads for painkillers and..."
msgstr ""

#: telly_tv/telly_fourth_encounter/0/g-0/27
msgctxt "Telly"
msgid "Ah screw it. I’m just too bummed out."
msgstr ""

#: telly_tv/telly_fourth_encounter/0/g-0/35/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "What’s wrong, Telly?"
msgstr ""

#: telly_tv/telly_fourth_encounter/0/g-0/36/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "You’re not allowed to be bummed out. You’re an appliance."
msgstr ""

#: telly_tv/telly_fourth_encounter/0/g-0/37/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "But I wanted to watch \"Balls to the Walls!\""
msgstr ""

#: telly_tv/telly_fourth_encounter/0/g-0/c-5/13
msgctxt "Telly"
msgid "You expect me to not emote?"
msgstr ""

#: telly_tv/telly_fourth_encounter/0/g-0/c-5/24
msgctxt "Telly"
msgid "With Valdiviflix’s boot right on my throat?"
msgstr ""

#: telly_tv/telly_fourth_encounter/0/g-0/c-6/7
msgctxt "Telly"
msgid "I already told you, nitwit. Valdiviflix acquired it."
msgstr ""

#: telly_tv/telly_fourth_encounter/0/g-0/c-6/18
msgctxt "Telly"
msgid "I can’t transmit it without a permit."
msgstr ""

#: telly_tv/telly_fourth_encounter/0/g-1/0
msgctxt "Telly"
msgid "It’s over; smell the odor?"
msgstr ""

#: telly_tv/telly_fourth_encounter/0/g-1/8
msgctxt "Telly"
msgid "That’s the entrenched stench of a hostile takeover."
msgstr ""

#: telly_tv/telly_fourth_encounter/0/g-1/16
msgctxt "Telly"
msgid "All the shows got new owners and the studios are in foreclosure."
msgstr ""

#: telly_tv/telly_fourth_encounter/0/g-1/24/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "It’s not that bad, Telly. Promise!"
msgstr ""

#: telly_tv/telly_fourth_encounter/0/g-1/25/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Oh is that what the smell is? I thought it was just trash day."
msgstr ""

#: telly_tv/telly_fourth_encounter/0/g-1/c-7/13
msgctxt "Telly"
msgid "It’s all that and worse. Let me show ya in verse."
msgstr ""

#: telly_tv/telly_fourth_encounter/0/g-1/c-8/7
msgctxt "Telly"
msgid "Hold on I ain’t through!"
msgstr ""

#: telly_tv/telly_fourth_encounter/0/g-1/c-8/15
msgctxt "Telly"
msgid "But yeah, it’s trash day too."
msgstr ""

#: telly_tv/telly_fourth_encounter/0/g-2/0
msgctxt "Telly"
msgid "No matter what I do Valdiviflix’ll always be better."
msgstr ""

#: telly_tv/telly_fourth_encounter/0/g-2/8
msgctxt "Telly"
msgid "They got all the consumers and they got all the cheddar."
msgstr ""

#: telly_tv/telly_fourth_encounter/0/g-2/16
msgctxt "Telly"
msgid "I can’t compete; I’m obsolete..."
msgstr ""

#: telly_tv/telly_fourth_encounter/0/g-2/24
msgctxt "Telly"
msgid "... someone oughta just yeet me into a shredder."
msgstr ""

#: telly_tv/telly_fourth_encounter/0/g-2/32/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "You’re not obsolete! You’ve got lots of great programming!"
msgstr ""

#: telly_tv/telly_fourth_encounter/0/g-2/33/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "That’s a fair assessment."
msgstr ""

#: telly_tv/telly_fourth_encounter/0/g-2/34/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Maybe you just need more shows?"
msgstr ""

#: telly_tv/telly_fourth_encounter/0/g-2/c-11/13
msgctxt "Telly"
msgid "More shows? To impose while people doze?"
msgstr ""

#: telly_tv/telly_fourth_encounter/0/g-3/0
msgctxt "Telly"
msgid "5,000 channels, 15,000 shows..."
msgstr ""

#: telly_tv/telly_fourth_encounter/0/g-3/8
msgctxt "Telly"
msgid "Yet no one wants any of those."
msgstr ""

#: telly_tv/telly_fourth_encounter/0/g-3/16
msgctxt "Telly"
msgid "When I was at the height of my powers, people would gather round me for hours and hours."
msgstr ""

#: telly_tv/telly_fourth_encounter/0/g-3/24
msgctxt "Telly"
msgid "They’d turn me on and waste the whole day..."
msgstr ""

#: telly_tv/telly_fourth_encounter/0/g-3/32
msgctxt "Telly"
msgid "But between smart phones, and streaming I’m just fading away..."
msgstr ""

#: telly_tv/telly_fourth_encounter/0/g-3/40
msgctxt "Telly"
msgid "Truth is, TV already died a long time ago."
msgstr ""

#: telly_tv/telly_fourth_encounter/0/g-3/48
msgctxt "Telly"
msgid "And all of us here? We're just basking in the afterglow."
msgstr ""

#: telly_tv/telly_fourth_encounter/0/g-3/56
msgctxt "Telly"
msgid "I'm not anything anymore - I'm no longer popular."
msgstr ""

#: telly_tv/telly_fourth_encounter/0/g-3/64
msgctxt "Telly"
msgid "In the end all I am is an overpriced monitor."
msgstr ""

#: telly_tv/telly_fourth_encounter/0/g-3/72/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Well I’m still here. And I’m not going anywhere."
msgstr ""

#: telly_tv/telly_fourth_encounter/0/g-3/73/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "You gonna wrap this pity party up soon? I’ve got some Valdiviflix to watch."
msgstr ""

#: telly_tv/telly_fourth_encounter/0/g-3/c-12/13
msgctxt "Telly"
msgid "Don’t even pretend that you care!"
msgstr ""

#: telly_tv/telly_fourth_encounter/0/g-3/c-12/24
msgctxt "Telly"
msgid "I’ve seen you watching Valdiviflix; I’m more than aware."
msgstr ""

#: telly_tv/telly_fourth_encounter/0/g-3/c-12/32/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "That’s true. But I can like you both. That’s ok."
msgstr ""

#: telly_tv/telly_fourth_encounter/0/g-3/c-12/32/1/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Can you blame me? Valdiviflix has the new season of \"Balls to the Walls!\""
msgstr ""

#: telly_tv/telly_fourth_encounter/0/g-3/c-12/32/2/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "That’s not true, Telly. I prefer you."
msgstr ""

#: telly_tv/telly_fourth_encounter/0/g-3/c-12/32/c-0/13
msgctxt "Telly"
msgid "Huh..."
msgstr ""

#: telly_tv/telly_fourth_encounter/0/g-3/c-12/32/c-0/21
msgctxt "Telly"
msgid "Never thought about that perspective before."
msgstr ""

#: telly_tv/telly_fourth_encounter/0/g-3/c-12/32/c-0/29
msgctxt "Telly"
msgid "But I guess why stop the show when you can watch an encore."
msgstr ""

#: telly_tv/telly_fourth_encounter/0/g-3/c-12/32/c-1/13
msgctxt "Telly"
msgid "That’s true, they do."
msgstr ""

#: telly_tv/telly_fourth_encounter/0/g-3/c-12/32/c-2/13
msgctxt "Telly"
msgid "Legit my sweet? Even though I’m obsolete?"
msgstr ""

#: telly_tv/telly_fourth_encounter/0/g-3/c-12/32/c-2/24/2/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "5,000 channels and 15,000%"
msgstr ""

#: telly_tv/telly_fourth_encounter/0/g-3/c-13/13
msgctxt "Telly"
msgid "I can see you’ve got a lot on your plate."
msgstr ""

#: telly_tv/telly_fourth_encounter/0/g-3/c-13/21
msgctxt "Telly"
msgid "So I’ll wrap this all up before it gets too late."
msgstr ""

#: telly_tv/telly_fourth_encounter/0/g-3/c-13/29/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Thank you!"
msgstr ""

#: telly_tv/telly_fourth_encounter/0/g-4/0
msgctxt "Telly"
msgid "Spectator, you’ve made quite an impression."
msgstr ""

#: telly_tv/telly_fourth_encounter/0/g-4/8
msgctxt "Telly"
msgid "So before we wrap up this binging session..."
msgstr ""

#: telly_tv/telly_fourth_encounter/0/g-4/16
msgctxt "Telly"
msgid "I hope you don’t mind, that I’m inclined, to make a confession..."
msgstr ""

#: telly_tv/xylophone_divert/0/0
msgctxt "Telly"
msgid "Try the internet, my pet."
msgstr ""

#: telly_tv/xylophone_divert/0/17
msgctxt "Xylophone Guy"
msgid "Or just our NEW times every Thursday night from 1:15am to 5:35am now on Channel 17!"
msgstr ""

#: telly_tv/xylophone_divert/0/34
msgctxt "Xylophone Guy"
msgid "Well hey there! I'm Gera-Gerald Dabrowski, amateur xylophone enthusiast, and you're watching \"Xylo-fun with Gerald Dabrowski!\" Featuring me, that's right, Gerald Dabrowski!"
msgstr ""

#: telly_tv/xylophone_divert/0/48/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Hi Gerald!"
msgstr ""

#: telly_tv/xylophone_divert/0/49/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I regret this decision immediately. Telly I'm sorry!"
msgstr ""

#: telly_tv/xylophone_divert/0/g-0/3
msgctxt "Xylophone Guy"
msgid "So you wanna learn the xylophone huh? And heck who doesn't! After all, it's the fastest growing instrument among both middle schoolers <i>and</i> retirees since 1982. Like I always say..."
msgstr ""

#: telly_tv/xylophone_divert/0/g-0/11
msgctxt "Xylophone Guy"
msgid "\"Can ya hit something? Then you can probably learn the xylophone!\""
msgstr ""

#: telly_tv/xylophone_divert/0/g-0/19/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Tell me everything oh wise one."
msgstr ""

#: telly_tv/xylophone_divert/0/g-1/0
msgctxt "Xylophone Guy"
msgid "Well I reckon if you wanna learn the xylophone, the very first thing you gotta know is how to properly hold your mallets. ‘Cause without proper mallet-holding technique, well then heck you’re just some shlub bangin’ on some metal tubes."
msgstr ""

#: telly_tv/xylophone_divert/0/g-1/8
msgctxt "Xylophone Guy"
msgid "Now it's very important to hold them in a relaxed grip, between the thumb and index finger, with your other fingers providing support..."
msgstr ""

#: telly_tv/xylophone_divert/0/g-1/16
msgctxt "Xylophone Guy"
msgid "And by other fingers course we’re talking about ya know... the middle finger. Uh, the p-pinky. That one where people wear their wedding rings. What’s that one called?"
msgstr ""

#: telly_tv/xylophone_divert/0/g-1/24
msgctxt "Xylophone Guy"
msgid "Anywho, you know the one I’m talkin’ about."
msgstr ""

#: telly_tv/xylophone_divert/0/g-1/32
msgctxt "Xylophone Guy"
msgid "Course I don’t wear <i>my</i> wedding ring at the moment... Pauline and I are goin’ through a \"trial separation.\" Just to see how it feels, ya know?"
msgstr ""

#: telly_tv/xylophone_divert/0/g-1/40
msgctxt "Xylophone Guy"
msgid "But she’s gonna come back. She’s definitely gonna come back—"
msgstr ""

#: telly_tv/xylophone_divert/0/g-1/48
msgctxt "Xylophone Guy"
msgid "Oh and the <i>6th finger!</i> Almost forgot that one!"
msgstr ""

#: telly_tv/xylophone_divert/0/g-1/56
msgctxt "Xylophone Guy"
msgid "Now don’t sweat it if you don’t get it right away. Heck, I’ve been practicing for 23 years and even I ain’t no expert. Me: Gerald Dabrowski!"
msgstr ""

#: telly_tv/xylophone_divert/0/g-1/64
msgctxt "Xylophone Guy"
msgid "Now movin’ onto the xylophone itself. The bars are arranged from..."
msgstr ""

#: telly_tv/xylophone_divert/0/g-1/72
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "Telly leans over, blocking Gerald from your view—he looks completely over this xylophone lesson."
msgstr ""

#: telly_tv/xylophone_divert/0/g-1/83
msgctxt "Telly"
msgid "Had enough, hot stuff?"
msgstr ""

#: telly_tv/xylophone_divert/0/g-1/91
msgctxt "Telly"
msgid "Cause if I gotta dip, I might just skip this whole relationship."
msgstr ""

#: telly_tv/xylophone_divert/0/g-1/99/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Yeah I think I'm good. What were we talking about?"
msgstr ""

#: telly_tv/xylophone_divert/0/g-1/100/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I'm sorry. I can't leave Gerald. Not now."
msgstr ""

#: telly_tv/xylophone_divert/0/g-1/c-4/7
msgctxt "Telly"
msgid "Then I fear, I'm outta here my dear. Peace!"
msgstr ""

#: telly_tv/xylophone_divert/0/g-1/c-4/18
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "Telly takes their leave. It's just you, Gerald, and the xylophone now."
msgstr ""

#: telly_tv/xylophone_divert/0/g-1/c-4/32
msgctxt "Xylophone Guy"
msgid "Now xylophone <i>bars</i> are arranged from lowest pitch to highest pitch from left to right, with the lowest pitch bars located on the left-hand side, and the highest pitch bars on the right-hand side. Simple right?"
msgstr ""

#: telly_tv/xylophone_divert/0/g-1/c-4/40
msgctxt "Xylophone Guy"
msgid "But see Pauline, she never quite understood that."
msgstr ""

#: telly_tv/xylophone_divert/0/g-1/c-4/48/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "She didn't appreciate you like I do, Gerald."
msgstr ""

#: telly_tv/xylophone_divert/0/g-1/c-4/48/1/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Can you teach me the marimba?"
msgstr ""

#: telly_tv/xylophone_divert/0/g-1/c-4/48/c-0/7
msgctxt "Xylophone Guy"
msgid "What? I’m sorry... you must’ve got the wrong impression."
msgstr ""

#: telly_tv/xylophone_divert/0/g-1/c-4/48/c-0/15
msgctxt "Xylophone Guy"
msgid "I’m a happily married man — have been for 34 years."
msgstr ""

#: telly_tv/xylophone_divert/0/g-1/c-4/48/c-0/23
msgctxt "Xylophone Guy"
msgid "It’s just a trial separation. See Pauline, she’s gonna come back. Any day now she’s gonna come back."
msgstr ""

#: telly_tv/xylophone_divert/0/g-1/c-4/48/c-0/31
msgctxt "Xylophone Guy"
msgid "I’m gonna look out that window and see her pull up in her lime green PT Cruiser... and she’s gonna say, \"Gerald, you were right: quitting your job to teach xylophone lessons on the public access channel <i>was</i> the right thing to do.\""
msgstr ""

#: telly_tv/xylophone_divert/0/g-1/c-4/48/c-0/42
msgctxt "Xylophone Guy"
msgid "But keep practicing, by golly! And one day I reckon you’ll be as gosh dang proficient as me..."
msgstr ""

#: telly_tv/xylophone_divert/0/g-1/c-4/48/c-0/50
msgctxt "Xylophone Guy"
msgid "Gerald Dabrowski, amateur xylophone enthusiast."
msgstr ""

#: telly_tv/xylophone_divert/0/g-1/c-4/48/c-1/18
msgctxt "Xylophone Guy"
msgid "Get the hell outta my sight."
msgstr ""

#: telly_tv/xylophone_divert/0/g-2/34
msgctxt "Reggie"
msgid "No - you can't have Gerald. He's all mine."
msgstr ""

#: telly_tv/xylophone_divert/0/g-2/42
msgctxt "Reggie"
msgid "We talk every night. He's got great stories about the war."
msgstr ""

#: telly_tv/telly_friendship/0/0
msgctxt "Telly"
msgid "You’ve proven yourself a great binge watching bud."
msgstr ""

#: telly_tv/telly_friendship/0/8
msgctxt "Telly"
msgid "Whether the show is a hit or the show is a dud."
msgstr ""

#: telly_tv/telly_friendship/0/16
msgctxt "Telly"
msgid "And if I asked ya back... I hope you wouldn’t be opposed."
msgstr ""

#: telly_tv/telly_friendship/0/24
msgctxt "Telly"
msgid "‘Cause I’ve got more genres / to impose on ya / with my flawless flows!"
msgstr ""

#: telly_tv/telly_friendship/0/32/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I'll get the remote!"
msgstr ""

#: telly_tv/telly_love/0/0
msgctxt "Telly"
msgid "After all my endless channel surfing, I’ve finally found..."
msgstr ""

#: telly_tv/telly_love/0/8
msgctxt "Telly"
msgid "... the absolute greatest spectator around!"
msgstr ""

#: telly_tv/telly_love/0/16
msgctxt "Telly"
msgid "And from my remote to my speakers to my cathode ray..."
msgstr ""

#: telly_tv/telly_love/0/24
msgctxt "Telly"
msgid "I wanna binge watch with you... ‘til we both waste away."
msgstr ""

#: telly_tv/telly_love/0/35/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Aww, I'll get my eyeballs lubricated."
msgstr ""

#: telly_tv/telly_love/0/36/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Actually, can we just be friends?"
msgstr ""

#: telly_tv/telly_love/0/c-1/7
msgctxt "Telly"
msgid "Hey if that's what you're feeling, I think that's appealing."
msgstr ""

#: telly_tv/telly_hate/0
msgctxt "Telly"
msgid "You’re the absolute <i>worst.</i> A pain. An irritation."
msgstr ""

#: telly_tv/telly_hate/11
msgctxt "Telly"
msgid "The human equivalent of a public access station."
msgstr ""

#: telly_tv/telly_hate/19
msgctxt "Telly"
msgid "Sorry to be harsh — and I don’t wanna provoke — but we’d both be way better off..."
msgstr ""

#: telly_tv/telly_hate/27
msgctxt "Telly"
msgid "... if you’d just lose the remote."
msgstr ""

#: telly_tv/telly_hate/35
msgctxt "Telly"
msgid "\"No soup for You!\""
msgstr ""

#: telly_tv/telly_hate/74
msgctxt "Reggie"
msgid "Oof, I think you just got cancelled."
msgstr ""

#: telly_tv/telly_love_return/0/0
msgctxt "Telly"
msgid "Well if it isn’t the VIP dream that makes my flatscreen scream..."
msgstr ""

#: telly_tv/telly_love_return/0/19/s/0 telly_tv/telly_friend_return/0/16/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Let's watch something!"
msgstr ""

#: telly_tv/telly_love_return/0/20/s/0 telly_tv/telly_friend_return/0/17/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I'm ready to Realize you, Telly."
msgstr ""

#: telly_tv/telly_love_return/0/c-0/7
msgctxt "Telly"
msgid "Anytime you wanna just swing on through... I’ll queue up something new for us to view!"
msgstr ""

#: telly_tv/telly_love_return/0/c-0/15
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "Telly's love for you ensures that there are no re-runs, ever."
msgstr ""

#: telly_tv/telly_friend_return/0/0
msgctxt "Telly"
msgid "My best friend's arrived - our ratings are revived!"
msgstr ""

#: telly_tv/telly_friend_return/0/8
msgctxt "Telly"
msgid "Hopefully that rhyme wasn't too contrived."
msgstr ""

#: telly_tv/telly_friend_return/0/c-0/7 telly_tv/telly_realize_return/0/c-1/10
msgctxt "Telly"
msgid "Anytime you want just swing on through, and I’ll queue up something new for us to view!"
msgstr ""

#: telly_tv/telly_friend_return/0/c-0/15
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "Your friend Telly serves you exactly what you want to watch, like a true friend."
msgstr ""

#: telly_tv/telly_hate_return/0/0
msgctxt "Telly"
msgid "You again? I thought I made myself perfectly clear."
msgstr ""

#: telly_tv/telly_hate_return/0/8
msgctxt "Telly"
msgid "We don’t like Valdiviflix fans round here."
msgstr ""

#: telly_tv/telly_hate_return/0/27/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Fine I didn't want to watch you anyway."
msgstr ""

#: telly_tv/telly_hate_return/0/28/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I was wrong to bring them up so much. You deserve love too. (USE SASS CANDY)"
msgstr ""

#: telly_tv/telly_hate_return/0/c-1/13
msgctxt "Telly"
msgid "No more of being enemies... Friends it'll be!"
msgstr ""

#: telly_tv/telly_realize_join/0/0
msgctxt "Telly"
msgid "Legit my pet? It's time to upgrade this TV set?"
msgstr ""

#: telly_tv/telly_realize_join/0/17/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Yes, I have what it takes."
msgstr ""

#: telly_tv/telly_realize_join/0/18/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "No, not just yet."
msgstr ""

#: telly_tv/telly_realize_join/0/c-1/10
msgctxt "Telly"
msgid "All good all good! I'm in no rush to be updated."
msgstr ""

#: telly_tv/telly_realize_return/0/0
msgctxt "Telly"
msgid "Yo yo yo! The VIP attendee!"
msgstr ""

#: telly_tv/telly_realize_return/0/8/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I'm ready to Realize you. I have what it takes."
msgstr ""

#: telly_tv/telly_realize_return/0/9/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Well I can't Realize you. I'm not ready yet."
msgstr ""

#: telly_tv/telly_realize_begin/6/b/1
msgctxt "Skylar"
msgid "Our first Realization is sweeping the nation!"
msgstr ""

#: telly_tv/telly_realize_begin/6/b/9
msgctxt "Skylar"
msgid "Oh I won't be able to keep doing that rhyming stuff any longer..."
msgstr ""

#: telly_tv/telly_realize_begin/9
msgctxt "Skylar"
msgid "Let's turn on the Telly!"
msgstr ""

#: telly_tv/telly_realize_begin/20
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "The spectral energy flows through your dateviators, and what was once merely a television, becomes...."
msgstr ""

#: telly_tv/telly_realized/0/3
msgctxt "Telly"
msgid "This ain’t a joke, artichoke."
msgstr ""

#: telly_tv/telly_realized/0/11
msgctxt "Telly"
msgid "I’m alive, it’s dope, and I’m so frickin’ stoked!"
msgstr ""

#: telly_tv/telly_realized/0/19
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "It’s true! Telly is alive! And for the first time you can finally enjoy each other’s company without being bombarded with commercials for pharmaceuticals every god damned 30 seconds."
msgstr ""

#: telly_tv/telly_realized/0/27
msgctxt "Telly"
msgid "While I’ll miss the thrill of being a shrill TV shill."
msgstr ""

#: telly_tv/telly_realized/0/35
msgctxt "Telly"
msgid "I’ve got so many desires I still need to fulfill."
msgstr ""

#: telly_tv/telly_realized/0/43
msgctxt "Telly"
msgid "And wow, maybe now we can find some time alone..."
msgstr ""

#: telly_tv/telly_realized/0/54
msgctxt "Telly"
msgid "And finally produce some steamy, must-see TV of our own..."
msgstr ""

#: telly_tv/telly_realized/0/62/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Actually I’d prefer to change the channel on this conversation."
msgstr ""

#: telly_tv/telly_realized/0/63/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Did you press the remote? ‘Cause suddenly I’m feeling turned on."
msgstr ""

#: telly_tv/telly_realized/0/c-0/7
msgctxt "Telly"
msgid "No prob, heartthrob. That’s not even displeasing."
msgstr ""

#: telly_tv/telly_realized/0/c-0/15
msgctxt "Telly"
msgid "I’m honestly happy, just being here breathing."
msgstr ""

#: telly_tv/telly_love_divert/3
msgctxt "Telly"
msgid "Well grab some popcorn, and spread those thighs."
msgstr ""

#: telly_tv/telly_love_divert/11
msgctxt "Telly"
msgid "‘Cause the following is definitely, \"viewer discretion advised.\""
msgstr ""

#: telly_tv/telly_love_divert/22
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "And boy howdy is it! The kind of steamy, raunchy scene much too graphic to show on cable television."
msgstr ""

#: telly_tv/telly_love_divert/30
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "Or in a video game rated M for Mature."
msgstr ""

#: telly_tv/telly_love_divert/38
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "But rest assured, it is very, <i>very</i> hot."
msgstr ""

#: telly_tv/telly_love_join/0/0
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "But, as I’m sure you’re well aware, being alive isn’t all just \"breathing\" and \"keying your ex’s car\" and \"begging your parents to help pay the legal fees for keying your ex's car.\""
msgstr ""

#: telly_tv/telly_love_join/0/8
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "And so Telly, like all adult humans of legal employment age, set out to earn a steady paycheck. Something that would allow him to purchase questionably effective health insurance at an absurdly inflated rate."
msgstr ""

#: telly_tv/telly_love_join/0/16
msgctxt "Telly"
msgid "Amazing update, my mate! We gotta celebrate!"
msgstr ""

#: telly_tv/telly_love_join/0/24
msgctxt "Telly"
msgid "I got a job reviewing Valdiviflix shows! It was well worth the wait."
msgstr ""

#: telly_tv/telly_love_join/0/32/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "But don't you hate Valdiviflix?"
msgstr ""

#: telly_tv/telly_love_join/0/g-0/0
msgctxt "Telly"
msgid "Listen sometimes you gotta fight back and howl."
msgstr ""

#: telly_tv/telly_love_join/0/g-0/8
msgctxt "Telly"
msgid "And sometimes you gotta know when to throw in the towel."
msgstr ""

#: telly_tv/telly_love_join/0/g-0/16
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "And thus Telly became the resident Valdiviflix review blogger for the entertainment website ContentBucket.com. He spends his days watching a never-ending stream of original reality series about baking. That no one has ever heard of or cares about."
msgstr ""

#: telly_tv/telly_love_join/0/g-0/24
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "Sometimes you try to make your way through his reviews, but honestly his whole bit where everything has to rhyme gets pretty stale after awhile."
msgstr ""
